  data: {
    LLM: "Only bid for Declarer if you hold the Jack or Nine of trumps. The center cards are a gamble; don't rely on them to fix a void.\n\nThe 'Trump Over' Maneuver: Use the rule allowing you to trump when you have the suit to steal high-point Tens or Aces from opponents early in the hand.\n\nRoem Calculation: Precisely calculate your sequence values before bidding. If an opponent is likely to have a higher sequence, your bid may fail because your Roem will be cancelled.",
